            "body": "> [@echasnovski](https://github.com/echasnovski) I did try 'sdb' but for some reason it inputs 'bd'.\n\nIt is usually a sign of either low 'timeoutlen' value (means there is too big of a pause between `s` and `b`) which might happen with 'folke/which-key.nvim' or different set up mappings for actions (which is not likely since the \"vanilla\" solution works).",
